":{"date":"2026-03-26T01:06:25Z","email":"luis.henriquez@wearemo.com","name":"Luis Henriquez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T01:06:25Z","email":"luis.henriquez@wearemo.com","name":"Luis Henriquez"},"message":"feat(agent-runner): persistent Claude sessions with stream-json bidirectional I/O\n\n- Add PersistentClaude class that keeps CLI process alive via --input-format stream-json\n- Messages sent via stdin, responses read from stdout — no process restart per reply\n- Session pool in main.py stores sessions keyed by session_id for reuse\n- Idle timeout (default 5 min, configurable via TOONY_SESSION_IDLE_TIMEOUT env var)\n- Background cleanup loop closes idle/dead sessions every 60s\n- Fallback path creates PersistentClaude with --resume when no session exists\n- Refactor task_executor to use shared _process_events helper\n- Update tests to mock PersistentClaude, add 16 new persistent session tests\n- Update CLAUDE.md and README.md with new architecture and env var docs","tree":{"sha":"fe209f60434f152a2521d4d56162c0bc8e5f72f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bikerlfh/toony-dev-core/git/trees/fe209f60434f152a2521d4d56162c0bc8e5f72f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bikerlfh/toony-dev-core/git/commits/80daafe4f319d2c3fef70aa67393e61f8961d562","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/bikerlfh/toony-dev-core/commit/80daafe4f319d2c3fef70aa67393e61f8961d562","node_id":"C_kwDORi4M8NoAKDgwZGFhZmU0ZjMxOWQyYzNmZWY3MGFhNjczOTNlNjFmODk2MWQ1NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bikerlfh/toony-dev-core/commit/2b8a0e15f068e97dcd900c686ab219f4ec5e0bc5","sha":"2b8a0e15f068e97dcd900c686ab219f4ec5e0bc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bikerlfh/toony-dev-core/commits/2b8a0e15f068e97dcd900c686ab219f4ec5e0bc5"}],"sha":"80daafe4f319d2c3fef70aa67393e61f8961d562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bikerlfh/toony-dev-core/commits/80daafe4f