:"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/prototype-zero/commits/aa62740c82c249b526cb704c47f29f57fe34fb3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-24T06:12:47Z","email":"buisihung321@gmail.com","name":"HungHCC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-24T06:12:47Z","email":"buisihung321@gmail.com","name":"HungHCC"},"message":"feat: Add project overview and system architecture documentation for flich-clone\n\n- Created project-overview-pdr.md detailing product overview, goals, non-goals, key design decisions, constraints, and technology stack.\n- Added system-architecture.md outlining high-level architecture, agent architecture, booking and status check flows, infrastructure architecture, authentication model, data flow summary, and deployment instructions.\n\nchore: Initialize flich-clone project structure\n\n- Added flich-clone.csproj for project configuration and dependencies.\n- Created HTTP test file flich-clone.http for REST API testing.\n- Added host.json for Azure Functions configuration.\n- Created local.settings.sample.json for local development settings.\n- Initialized project.json for Nx project configuration.\n\nbuild: Set up infrastructure as code with Bicep\n\n- Added main.bicep for resource provisioning including managed identity, storage, Azure OpenAI, Durable Task Scheduler, and Function App.\n- Created modules for identity, storage, OpenAI, and durable task scheduler.\n- Added main.parameters.json for parameterization of Bicep deployment.\n\ntest: Implement REST API tests for individual agents and orchestrations\n\n- Added tests for SupervisorAgent, RideRequestAgent, PricingAgent, DriverMatchAgent, and RideStatusAgent.\n- Included tests for orchestration flows BookRide and CheckRideStatus.\n\nfix: Correct Azure Functions runtime and dependencies\n\n- Updated flich-clone.csproj to target .NET 10.0 and include necessary Azure Functions packages.\n- Adjusted app settings in function app module for proper Azure service integration.","tree":{"sha":"4729cec33a78e91e4be330c24b0b16db6e247b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/prototype-zero/git/trees/4729cec33a78e91e4be330c24b0b16db6e247b79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/prototype-zero/git/commits/aa62740c82c249b526cb704c47f29f57fe34fb3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38785848?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/buisihung11","id":38785848,"login":"buisihung11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4Nzg1ODQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/buisihung11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/buisihung11/prototype-zero/commit/aa62740c82c249b526cb704c47f29f57fe34fb3b","node_id":"C_kwDORi6HOdoAKGFhNjI3NDBjODJjMjQ5YjUyNmNiNzA0YzQ3ZjI5ZjU3ZmUzNGZiM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/buisihung11/prototype-zero/commit/9123cf6a490f7a59607c62d20c3f7b41ad837595","sha":"9123cf6a490f7a59607c62d20c3f7b41ad837595","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/prototype-zero/commits/9123cf6a490f7a59607c62d20c3f7b41ad8375