le-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AQUILA04/LandReg/commits/6bc245f9a0fe1453d497c4671cf1bb0940ee4112/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T08:29:28Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T08:29:28Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(kafka): implement resilience across afis-master and afis-service\n\n- Disabled Kafka auto-commit and switched to manual ACKs across both microservices (`afis-master` and `afis-service`).\n- Added robust error handling via `DeadLetterPublishingRecoverer` and `FixedBackOff` (3 retries).\n- Updated listener methods (`AfisMasterConsumer`, `MatcherService`) to inject and explicitly call `Acknowledgment.acknowledge()` upon success.\n- Modified Architecture layer tests to correctly permit `Broker` interactions.\n\nCo-authored-by: AQUILA04 <45388225+AQUILA04@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf79a0497ab1a8f5be28d0ec018f2dafc9c29df9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AQUILA04/LandReg/git/trees/cf79a0497ab1a8f5be28d0ec018f2dafc9c29df9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AQUILA04/LandReg/git/commits/6bc245f9a0fe1453d497c4671cf1bb0940ee4112","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-l