comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:32:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"mobile-gateway: proxy PUT/DELETE /categories/:id (+ GET /:id)\n\nAdds the missing category-management endpoints so the mobile app can do\nfull CRUD on categories. The product-service CategoryController already\nexposes:\n\n  GET    /categories/{id}\n  PUT    /categories/{id}    (MANAGER)\n  DELETE /categories/{id}    (MANAGER)\n\nso this is purely a proxy wiring change at the gateway. POST + GET (all)\nwere already exposed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4adb6d531837185f9d8b7c6e320d8d61c84dcd43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/git/trees/4adb6d531837185f9d8b7c6e320d8d61c84dcd43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/git/commits/b72d5529ce37bcd10a37a9086a716a5a2d64f0d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/commit/b72d5529ce37bcd10a37a9086a716a5a2d64f0d6","node_id":"C_kwDORjHUcNoAKGI3MmQ1NTI5Y2UzN2JjZDEwYTM3YTkwODZhNzE2YTVhMmQ2NGYwZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/commit/1ddd2bce3d0a243aab4db3863b2e573776640916","sha":"1ddd2bce3d0a243aab4db3863b2e573776640916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/commits/1ddd2bce3d0a243aab4db3863b2e573776640916"}],"sha":"b72d5529ce37bcd10a37a9086a716a5a2d64f0d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/commits/b72d5529ce37bcd10a37a9086a716a5a2d64f0d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/commits/1ddd2bce3d0a243aab4db3863b2e573776640916/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:24:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:24:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"mobile-gateway: proxy /stock/thresholds and /stock/consume\n\nAdds two mobile-gateway routes that proxy to inventory-service endpoints\nwhich already exist on the Java side:\n\n  PUT  /stock/thresholds  ->  PUT  /inventory/thresholds\n  POST /stock/consume     ->  POST /inventory/consume   (multipart)\n\nBoth are placed before the GET /:warehouseId route so the static\n''thresholds'' / ''consume'' path segments win.\n\nfixRequestBody is harmless for the multipart consume body (it only\nre-streams JSON/urlencoded), so the same proxy instance is reused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a56e4ceb3fae49a431cbddad2429bf523fd4b224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/git/trees/a56e4ceb3fae49a431cbddad2429bf523fd4b224"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/git/commits/1ddd2bce3d0a243aab4db3863b2e573776640916","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rossiko22/Inventory-Supply-Management/commit/1ddd2bce3d0a243aab4db3863b2e573776640916","node_id":"C_kwDORjHUcNoAKDFkZ