/3820e5cc09671a5dfea601307f4307bcf0ffd8f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:13:29Z","email":"55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hervé Duchesne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:13:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build: the jExperience integration compiles against the floor of its OSGi ranges, and against the ceiling in CI (#385)\n\n* build: the jExperience integration compiles against the floor of its OSGi ranges, one version\n\nThe module compiled against 4.2.1, and a jexperience-floor profile, run as a second CI step,\nrecompiled it against 3.4.0 to catch a 4.x-only call. Compiling against 3.4.0 alone holds the\nsame guarantee in the one build, and drops the second property, the profile and the CI step.\n\n* build: a jexperience-ceiling profile recompiles the jExperience integration against the newest 4.x in CI, from clean","tree":{"sha":"89625c5b0cdc747933b73172b082edc60eb845a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/89625c5b0cdc747933b73172b082edc60eb845a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/3820e5cc09671a5dfea601307f4307bcf0ffd8f6","verification":{"payload":"tree 89625c5b0cdc747933b73172b082edc60eb845a8\nparent 83df6f48caa215605dcfdd92ffcfcca4c1d3dbbc\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1791368009 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791368009 +0200\n\nbuild: the jExperience integration compiles against the floor of its OSGi ranges, and against the ceiling in CI (#385)\n\n* build: the jExperience integration compiles against the floor of its OSGi ranges, one version\n\nThe module compiled against 4.2.1, and a jexperience-floor profile, run as a second CI step,\nrecompiled it against 3.4.0 to catch a 4.x-only call. Compiling against 3.4.0 alone holds the\nsame guarantee in the one build, and drops the second property, the profile and the CI step.\n\n* build: a jexperience-ceiling p