c09671a5dfea601307f4307bcf0ffd8f6","node_id":"C_kwDORjIIPtoAKDM4MjBlNWNjMDk2NzFhNWRmZWE2MDEzMDdmNDMwN2JjZjBmZmQ4ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/formidable/commit/83df6f48caa215605dcfdd92ffcfcca4c1d3dbbc","sha":"83df6f48caa215605dcfdd92ffcfcca4c1d3dbbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/83df6f48caa215605dcfdd92ffcfcca4c1d3dbbc"}],"sha":"3820e5cc09671a5dfea601307f4307bcf0ffd8f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/3820e5cc09671a5dfea601307f4307bcf0ffd8f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55382113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hduchesne","id":55382113,"login":"hduchesne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzgyMTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/83df6f48caa215605dcfdd92ffcfcca4c1d3dbbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:05:03Z","email":"55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hervé Duchesne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:05:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: remove tests whose coverage another test already holds (#384)\n\n* test: remove unit tests whose coverage another test already holds\n\nEach removed test takes the same branch, on the same input partition, as a\nkept test whose assertions include its own.\n\n* test: remove the e2e tests whose coverage another spec already holds\n\n- fields/20: the multistep submission, which integrity/60 builds from the same constants and\n  asserts further, down to the stored submission.\n- validation/41: the live rendering through the reference, which every live spec goes\n  through (createPublishedLiveFormPage places the form by reference, visitLiveForm waits for\n  hydration).\n- logics/56: the first invalidation test, folded into the second one, which now also waits\n  on the initial hidden state.\n\n* test: drop the unused step import and name the bypass the kept auth and CAPTCHA tests now carry\n\n* test: freeze the JS-variable sampler so only the invalidation event can flip the field","tree":{"sha":"c207a945e3b47275e256667d87aebf2573afa1a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/c207a945e3b47275e256667d87aebf2573afa1a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/83df6f48caa215605dcfdd92ffcfcca4c1d3dbbc","verification":{"payload":"tree c207a945e3b47275e256667d87aebf2573afa1a8\nparent 899144bb9220bbf4931069bea7587ae9ebe94609\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1791367503 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791367503 +0200\n\ntest: remove tests whose coverage another test already holds (#384)\n\n* test: remove unit tests whose coverage another test already holds\n\nEach removed test takes the same branch, on the same input partition, as a\nkept test whose assertions include its own.\n\n* test: remove the e2e tests whose coverage another spec already holds\n\n- fields/20: the multistep submission, which integrity/60 builds from the same constants and\n  asserts further, down to the stored submission.\n- validation/41: the live rendering through the reference, which every live spec goes\n  through (createPublishedLiveFormPage places the form by reference, visitLiveForm waits for\n  hydration).\n- logics/56: the first invalidation test, folded into the second one, which now also waits\n  on the initial hidden state.\n\n* test: drop the unused step import and name the bypass the kept auth and CAPTCHA tests now carry\n\n* test: freeze the JS-variable sampler so only the invalidation event can flip the field","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxhlPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvEEQAD4lJaM0+cCabO9vOzoOF8Xt\nwzSYzjv90adeQj62SMpYR5+uIX0Xt6mxn+f0FNvH4bjHE23TN04N5z740PgjnbWs\niMF3h47q71925YZBd8uPfJ5+3xaQ0Dn7MSoYrn4PwpN8vRogXoso1ZnKdGYrpqxE\nplMc8j1fLVtxvkU2atjhQ45T3yV8h/I95HwHHNvP8UgorioSfCEXs1BGw1r43a+n\nHg03N2A1bATp0TC0ZjXuJsKw+481Ph8VqhjFL8ltx7y4dJpjzLHf+YPY6s7F40Rn\n7N1vuonF+NtXFwLNdW6117hiz2C+PDBKfVJOTmYthe0RRFjZecHmJa2WRhJio7mY\n+VcyWTULMX+hEE/S+YHDlyLQTKASrvihRTLEgzxzpkjrZ8aUs+sAvKlfWoZhiRra\nvAyiEZa4wMzEZqLOXd4IGzuplM7W3pptE8SG02BiK8swtzDfqBseHJ/F0JDs82qV\ntAPsgDVAMy8bv51D/YROHX96c6HtlJ6b7oS6w9DhReYDVuB/nzM43rBwgI4Mtj0b\nbNm1usq1jHM/qQ5KHCj/S0oTZbK2AfdDa7XLKLqRkuYEGoqybalzAB3OepvlCuOr\nboEjtVk49/PZYgLU+icyp4iK72h/lgLToiIkBH7YlMDhxaDXkhcvkze4JrWKnPcV\nJfGgenbvXN6BDtyQIXlS\n=fHEW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T10:05:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,