","html_url":"https://github.com/hduchesne","id":55382113,"login":"hduchesne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzgyMTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/96c7da1f1b2e0f2f045fb2f1364552309bc39d18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:43:27Z","email":"55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hervé Duchesne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:43:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: the Field actions switch is placed by formidable-elements, the engine keeps only its list''s hide (#380)\n\n* refactor: the Field actions switch is placed by formidable-elements, the engine keeps only its list''s hide\n\nThe placement of the switch in Field settings moves from the engine''s\noverride on fmdbmix:fieldActions to an override of the same mixin shipped by\nformidable-elements, which places every other engine mixin of that section\nfrom its own bundle. The engine''s file keeps only the children-block hide,\nthe behaviour of its own list, and its four bundles drop the copy of\nfmdb.section.fieldSettings the first cut needed (review of #377).\n\nMeasured on 8.2.4: last in Field settings on text, email, select, number,\ndate, textarea and checkbox fields; alone in the section on the hidden input\n(en Field settings, fr Reglages du champ, from the elements bundle); none on\nthe file field; activated on a field with actions; children block hidden;\nturned on in the Content Editor and saved, it adds the mixin and its list.\ncheck-editor-forms now finds no shared label key. Engine suite 505.\n\n* docs: the field actions decision row and spec 225 name elements as the switch''s placement","tree":{"sha":"651589458d17c33704b9a7836b659d252139131c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/651589458d17c33704b9a7836b659d252139131c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/96c7da1f1b2e0f2f045fb2f1364552309bc39d18","verification":{"payload":"tree 651589458d17c33704b9a7836b659d252139131c\nparent f17cd8204f993766830a3327df229ef2c4e66b4e\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1791287007 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791287007 +0200\n\nrefactor: the Field actions switch is placed by formidable-elements, the engine keeps only its list''s hide (#380)\n\n* refactor: the Field actions switch is placed by formidable-elements, the engine keeps only its list''s hide\n\nThe placement of the switch in Field settings moves from the engine''s\noverride on fmdbmix:fieldActions to an override of the same mixin shipped by\nformidable-elements, which places every other engine mixin of that section\nfrom its own bundle. The engine''s file keeps only the children-block hide,\nthe behaviour of its own list, and its four bundles drop the copy of\nfmdb.section.fieldSettings the first cut needed (review of #377).\n\nMeasured on 8.2.4: last in Field settings on text, email, select, number,\ndate, textarea and checkbox fields; alone in the section on the hidden input\n(en Field settings, fr Reglages du champ, from the elements bundle); none on\nthe file field; activated on a field with actions; children block hidden;\nturned on in the Content Editor and saved, it adds the mixin and its list.\ncheck-editor-forms now finds no shared label key. Engine suite 505.\n\n* docs: the field actions decision row and spec 225 name elements as the switch''s placement","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx