idable/commit/2a924b4835fc9854da4dd989bc0963df8f34322d","sha":"2a924b4835fc9854da4dd989bc0963df8f34322d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/2a924b4835fc9854da4dd989bc0963df8f34322d"}],"sha":"f17cd8204f993766830a3327df229ef2c4e66b4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/f17cd8204f993766830a3327df229ef2c4e66b4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55382113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hduchesne","id":55382113,"login":"hduchesne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzgyMTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/2a924b4835fc9854da4dd989bc0963df8f34322d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:28:14Z","email":"55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hervé Duchesne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:28:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: the Field actions switch closes the Field settings section of a field''s editor (#377)\n\n* feat: the Field actions switch closes the Field settings section of a field''s editor\n\nHDU: move Field actions to the end of Field settings. The engine''s override\non fmdbmix:fieldActions places the switch there (fieldset rank 6, after the\nvalidation messages) with \"alwaysPresent\" - a switch without a property of\nits own is dropped once moved otherwise - and declares the section with its\nlabel and rank, so that the hidden input, which has no other setting, still\ngets it; the engine''s bundles carry fmdb.section.fieldSettings for that.\n\nMeasured on a running instance: last in Field settings on text, email,\nselect, number, date, textarea and checkbox fields, alone in the section on\nthe hidden input, en and fr labels, activated on a field with actions, none on\nthe file field; turned on from the editor, it adds the mixin and its list.\nSpec 225 asserts the new place; the layout and field-actions docs record the\ndecision superseding 2026-10-01.\n\n* build: check-editor-forms holds the section and fieldset labels two modules share\n\nReview of #377: the engine now carries fmdb.section.fieldSettings too, and\nthe editor keeps the label of the override merged last, overrides of one\npriority being ordered by a tie-break - two wordings would show one label or\nthe other by field type, and only prose kept them equal. Every labelKey and\ndescriptionKey a form override gives a section or a fieldset must now hold\nthe same text, in the same languages, in every bundle carrying it (escaped\nand raw UTF-8 decoded alike). Proved: green as is, red on a reworded fr\nlabel and on a missing de one, red when the root cannot be read.","tree":{"sha":"4fdaad911716a5a60761d3744e27982d3a38c176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/4fdaad911716a5a60761d3744e27982d3a38c176"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/2a924b4835fc9854da4dd989bc0963df8f34322d","verification":{"payload":"tree 4fdaad911716a5a60761d3744e27982d3a38c176\nparent 2032414d041f75a8b83131420ac12885786c87fb\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1791217694 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791217694 +0200\n\nfeat: the Field actions switch closes the Field settings section of a field''s editor (#377)\n\n* feat: the Field actions switch closes the Field settings section of a field''s editor\n\nHDU: move Field actions to the end of Field settings. The engine''s override\non fmdbmix:fieldActions places the switch there (fieldset rank 6, after the\nvalidation messages) with \"alwaysPresent\" - a switch without a property of\nits own is dropped once moved otherwise - and declares the section with its\nlabel and rank, so that the hidden input, which has no other setting, still\ngets it; the engine''s bundles carry fmdb.section.fieldSettings for that.\n\nMeasured on a running instance: last in Field settings on text, email,\nselect, number, date, textarea and checkbox fields, alone in the section on\nthe hidden input, en and fr labels, activated on a field with actions, none on\nthe file field; turned on from the editor, it adds the mixin and its list.\nSpec 225 asserts the new place; the layout and field-actions docs record the\ndecision superseding 2026-10-01.\n\n* build: check-editor-forms holds the section and fieldset labels two modules share\n\nReview of #377: the engine now carries fmdb.section.fieldSettings too, and\nthe editor keeps the label of the override merged last, overrides of one\npriority being ordered by a tie-break - two wordings would show one label or\nthe other by field type, and only prose kept them equal. Every labelKey and\ndescriptionKey a form override gives a section or a fieldset must now hold\nthe same text, in the same languages, in every bundle carrying it (escaped\nand raw UTF-8 decoded alike). Proved: green as is, red on a reworded fr\nlabel and on a missing de one, red when the root cannot be read.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9AeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkE4QAEPQVknWUVyQ4HGs9V3j36qv\nfKJt/IlCdn67n/0LAcbHQ4vADzwaWS48kB+2mWXYsNHPSKPZvQL8lu8JPNqD8qsc\n7ZAvtjYbpoJMWiwDMwDq3E+UWXj5VSvhamc/MuvTPW3ai1HGi374zR/3HOsXGa4I\nybbOH7D/I