NDM5ZTE0MzVlNTkwNTY0NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/formidable/commit/c29b8f7fe26f88cfa4a7a7f81f4acdab7d95bca2","sha":"c29b8f7fe26f88cfa4a7a7f81f4acdab7d95bca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/c29b8f7fe26f88cfa4a7a7f81f4acdab7d95bca2"}],"sha":"e22851e98159bc147a7a78e439e1435e59056462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/e22851e98159bc147a7a78e439e1435e59056462"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55382113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hduchesne","id":55382113,"login":"hduchesne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzgyMTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/c29b8f7fe26f88cfa4a7a7f81f4acdab7d95bca2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:21:31Z","email":"55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hervé Duchesne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:21:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: each sample mailbox check names its configuration like the engine''s own entries (#358)\n\n* fix: each sample mailbox check names its configuration like the engine''s own entries — Formidable, Field actions, the check as the contributor sees it, the service in brackets\n\n* ci: the two sample mailbox checks, twins on purpose, left out of Sonar''s duplication detection\n\nThe quality gate on this PR failed on one condition only: 32.6% of the new lines\nduplicated, against a 3% threshold, with zero issues of any kind. The duplicate is\nthe Config interface each sample check now carries: an @ObjectClassDefinition has\nto live in its component''s own bundle and bear its own name for the configuration\nmanager to tell the two apart, and the shared wording is already factored in\nSampleEndpointSettings. A project copies one of the two, so the repetition is the\nsample''s point. sonar.cpd.exclusions is a project-level analysis property, hence\nthe root pom, next to the S6842 exclusion and with the same kind of comment.","tree":{"sha":"46dc58390489563d2e86a9fed5218ce230c93e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/46dc58390489563d2e86a9fed5218ce230c93e51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/c29b8f7fe26f88cfa4a7a7f81f4acdab7d95bca2","verification":{"payload":"tree 46dc58390489563d2e86a9fed5218ce230c93e51\nparent b8da625b95e4e983e35b07ef64fb2749443d81d5\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1790875291 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790875291 +0200\n\nfix: each sample mailbox check names its configuration like the engine''s own entries (#358)\n\n* fix: each sample mailbox check names its configuration like the engine''s own entries — Formidable, Field actions, the check as the contributor sees it, the service in brackets\n\n* ci: the two sample mailbox checks, twins on purpose, left out of Sonar''s duplication detection\n\nThe quality gate on this PR failed on one condition only: 32.6% of the new lines\nduplicated, against a 3% threshold, with zero issues of any kind. The duplicate is\nthe Config interface each sample check now carries: an @ObjectClassDefinition has\nto live in its component''s own bundle and bear its own name for the configuration\nmanager to tell the two apart, and the shared wording is already factored in\nSampleEndpointSettings. A project copies one of the two, so the repetition is the\nsample''s point. sonar.cpd.exclusions is a project-level analysis property, hence\nthe root pom, next to the S6842 exclusion and with the same kind of comment.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvpabCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5bcQACOBGwDuHt9SXr4TqsVN25rF\n2hKifuOrTYX/V9D6OjUUfesnCKFKoMPg2GVr8T/ys1jslmmNSvYupSzBBxaqO7Ij\nBjB87qXKmxQpzl9xaozWcXqjzs1T4zJGohLFZxX6R0YiM6IZOnS7XiQagkSK6N4R\nuwe5lsD6E4XQ1wmHHBk0YjkdBP81FB9yjYB40kGcA8Rtm+Kymra2Rq0TYfMLw9UX\nb3ojPetKR7Cv5TZQiifkLYBlcgAY/yfVPPEob7dqghEzNnIcWiuNwi5sH8+C7gCz\n6LNpvPoTEke1PE5bxtEbtMyvzZxV2x/YbrTDSFWge3o9uAL7E4RZhUtKbDtLXO/O\n2lRFtK5uA3d6z3wXbXEqKmMnEJ9d3XFq4IXo0K0BshCrUziWxxarvR0XXFIXaq1G\nEGiQcHtj1yihXP+e8sza1Zf+7bHUbIxqYaKkJVJgKEWDf8SZ/bARhTw/rcTB8cxE\nga2ZidqpI7rD5qtJmIkd/r92tDzxrPLi3QzI8aCq4eY8SeGnqQsP4xw4ugLALh5I\nYToGBYqNs+I65FFD1XslHk0gIhwPjy2Jrz4SWMk/B0t150zl1LI6q29i94l8hOzF\ngaY4qMt7KUv/DxrG3tw0BAWq+IuOfriv8fq+i24EHCWiFKiACRovVXZ7/UTsHnz1\nangkBFT8qZLB3NbBB4vu\n=y7bt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T17:21:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"htt