22dee76c15ffc0300a904a4491840a75"}],"sha":"b4e3f11d1250e2b441d788275242e1e1d4630b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/b4e3f11d1250e2b441d788275242e1e1d4630b15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55382113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hduchesne","id":55382113,"login":"hduchesne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzgyMTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/546b7b3e22dee76c15ffc0300a904a4491840a75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:12:37Z","email":"55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hervé Duchesne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:12:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: a field action''s card is the form action''s card, and its list says what the form''s says (#348)\n\n* fix: a field action''s card is the form action''s card, and its list says what the form''s says\n\nThe card under a field drew three grey badges reading the action''s settings — when it runs, what a refusal does, what an unanswered check means — where the form action''s card draws the title, the key parameter and the description on one line each. One card for the two kinds: the settings are read in the action''s editor, for a field action as for a form action. The list''s hint said one thing more than the form''s (\"the first refusal wins\"); it now says the same, in both languages. The badge classes, their variable and their six labels go with it.\n\n* chore: changelog entry for #348\n\n* docs: the last mention of the settings badges leaves CONTEXT.md, and the changelog entry goes — field actions never shipped","tree":{"sha":"34be95a3e2c2273f5853ab6450ec23f430aaabd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/34be95a3e2c2273f5853ab6450ec23f430aaabd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/546b7b3e22dee76c15ffc0300a904a4491840a75","verification":{"payload":"tree 34be95a3e2c2273f5853ab6450ec23f430aaabd3\nparent 54f8386d0a64f33996476850e11291591957d532\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1790575957 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790575957 +0200\n\nfix: a field action''s card is the form action''s card, and its list says what the form''s says (#348)\n\n* fix: a field action''s card is the form action''s card, and its list says what the form''s says\n\nThe card under a field drew three grey badges reading the action''s settings — when it runs, what a refusal does, what an unanswered check means — where the form action''s card draws the title, the key parameter and the description on one line each. One card for the two kinds: the settings are read in the action''s editor, for a field action as for a form action. The list''s hint said one thing more than the form''s (\"the first refusal wins\"); it now says the same, in both languages. The badge classes, their variable and their six labels go with it.\n\n* chore: changelog entry for #348\n\n* docs: the last mention of the settings badges leaves CONTEXT.md, and the changelog entry goes — field actions never shipped","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqugVVCRC