https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/8240fd353e77d8823fc7aca003ebbae7797fd542"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55382113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hduchesne","id":55382113,"login":"hduchesne","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzgyMTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hduchesne","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/commits/ab89b434071bc0b126581ea88b969a305d14ace9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:26:33Z","email":"55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hervé Duchesne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:26:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: a mapping rule is written for a form only (#335)\n\nJahia republishes a folder by removing and re-adding it in live, and the sync listener, which\nresolves a removed node by its identifier when no form stands above it, then hands the folder''s\nidentifier to the synchroniser. Read as a form, the folder yielded a rule keyed on its uuid, with\nevery mapped field beneath it as actions — one such rule per playground run, on the contents folder.\n\nFormMappingReader.read now answers \"maps nothing\" for a node that is not a fmdbmix:formRoot,\nbefore asking jCustomer for its schema, so the synchroniser deletes any such rule and writes\nnone. Unit test: a folder is never queried and the catalog is never asked.","tree":{"sha":"9962cb685d0bb29013048964af12507265751af9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/9962cb685d0bb29013048964af12507265751af9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/ab89b434071bc0b126581ea88b969a305d14ace9","verification":{"payload":"tree 9962cb685d0bb29013048964af12507265751af9\nparent 23c0902fb5862cb9cd71589f801e2bacf79926f2\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1789658793 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789658793 +0200\n\nfix: a mapping rule is written for a form only (#335)\n\nJahia republishes a folder by removing and re-adding it in live, and the sync listener, which\nresolves a removed node by its identifier when no form stands above it, then hands the folder''s\nidentifier to the synchroniser. Read as a form, the folder yielded a rule keyed on its uuid, with\nevery mapped field beneath it as actions — one such rule per playground run, on the contents folder.\n\nFormMappingReader.read now answers \"maps nothing\" for a node that is not a fmdbmix:formRoot,\nbefore asking jCustomer for its schema, so the synchroniser deletes any such rule and writes\nnone. Unit test: a folder is never queried and the catalog is never asked.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrAapCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA93UQADbQs0MGy8WG4RCLPpIMvbel\nyYLrtacuTM7IFqE+gjVWmpclgXLfxS9kyjkGioePc/3LWrmrQLZViumRHGRXmpt5\nNG/ORUUCA0JxMfj4QvLv5vmNiZ2sAzxF0zsPIGdFtmsOsOsJWtVkRxz2RFtfi19v\nUt2lnwexQhehgXm+UwL+shXLaBGdkB2ujrvx2peRNnWy/suFT54mDiKlinbgYVad\nH5TNDg8krAX+Is1SAFZKXsQjG+PCbLYIgHlx/V5s82Y4QnMR9JskqCY20g6TPvjd\nmw5/vgcuYWzb42K/sWjM164TeL1QNcpOP3uH0x5KZnjxwwuR6vmmN9Kdz5tT8U/T\nkuUi8s5N/EE/6If5clPs6UIEgAEPXqdbZdJyKsF7UIzHzuQDI8/UGouFnQsw408/\nDROl8kKqFeEMesRl7A5Zvw9/+G/zdeD0vCUlkYsproz710lEp9klsYhI4kktCzC4\nOscrbK05431Pn