n pages sat flat in docs/, where the template-set developer, the\nthird-party module developer, the administrator and the maintainer all looked\nin the same place. Each page moves (git mv, history kept) into the folder of\nits reader, every folder opens with a README saying who it is for and what is\nin it, docs/README.md is the map and the root README points at the four\nfolders instead of listing thirteen pages.\n\nEvery reference follows: the relative links between pages, the docs/…md paths\nquoted in Java and TypeScript comments, the CND, the module READMEs, the\nagent files and a pending changelog entry. Three defects that predate the\nmove go with it: a relative link one level short in the ConditionalLogic\nREADME, a docs/security.md that never existed in a skill file, an anchor\ntypo in the release issue template.\n\nscripts/check-doc-links.mjs keeps it so: every relative Markdown link (path\nand anchor) and every quoted docs/…md path must resolve, checked in the\nstatic-analysis job. It runs in under a second and passes on this tree.\n\n* chore: the changelog entry references the pull request\n\n* chore: the documentation link check skips the local notes folder","tree":{"sha":"d4d0c86fd48c51a66366a8326599669f06d432ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/trees/d4d0c86fd48c51a66366a8326599669f06d432ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/formidable/git/commits/a03c20ace2df667d21ea10a19e7b3c58b62c3afa","verification":{"payload":"tree d4d0c86fd48c51a66366a8326599669f06d432ee\nparent 210631b162e79663a92b0efd59290711658832c5\nauthor Hervé Duchesne <55382113+hduchesne@users.noreply.github.com> 1788969098 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788969098 +0200\n\ndocs: one folder per reader — styling, extension, administration, architecture (#307)\n\n* docs: one folder per reader — styling, extension, administration, architecture\n\nSixteen pages sat flat in docs/, where the template-set developer, the\nthird-party module developer, the administrator and the maintainer all looked\nin the same place. Each page moves (git mv, history kept) into the folder of\nits reader, every folder opens with a README saying who it is for and what is\nin it, docs/README.md is the map and the root README points at the four\nfolders instead of listing thirteen pages.\n\nEvery reference follows: the relative links between pages, the docs/…md paths\nquoted in Java and TypeScript comments, the CND, the module READMEs, the\nagent files and a pending changelog entry. Three defects that predate the\nmove go with it: a relative link one level short in the ConditionalLogic\nREADME, a docs/security.md that never existed in a skill file, an anchor\ntypo in the release issue template.\n\nscripts/check-doc-links.mjs keeps it so: every relative Markdown link (path\nand anchor) and every quoted docs/…md path must resolve, checked in the\nstatic-analysis job. It runs in under a second and passes on this tree.\n\n* chore: the changelog entry references the pull request\n\n* chore: the documentation link check skips the local notes folder","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoYCKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAF40QAEhUesxZetmSKyypY9S0Fmsm\naXMy5HepTFprRvRjLwUw7UmgUt5TSP3Akr56T0rOUT0ULaU9ajzRtfQrm4r1kORw\nxfX0ipAKJEQRTV7lvcITiQ1RS9impxoUh75VN2ijIJVakb/FULhXu02NyNYdIJGF\n3vv8ri1urZXqrnaIHZqb04D8swGD7Y758wmdp5IfnM48t7E2nkwQsAICCELfEh2d\nMPIX0BB9LQGXnm4h3uO/jYAkTtSBFeu8JRim6CT3ZIYBFte9gChyvtE9Ujz0c3EL\nnRc2aFW0GINGWZnPY9ZlsVDBNqgavIpdsw1B287HQ8wpI4RWZBgauzT9SmpvqMye\n21D7I2/gR6vxOepLuSVmKAZDZkw42wufz5Sz3JaDT4Y6AzwXnvRimJV7+9AaI7NI\nc45A+nWB2DY/bNSVlhnDsNxt1K5RCah65f3ru1ZoF9LF384wcmgL6c7hE1mBEfpS\nUM4mFoF5JXUvyj3t7EbJ5jBtCJKIL0pIq8M8yYwlpz2Tp0bdTckvCXd1be/wKGmu\neB9xGF5FZxQUarJrS7I8TiiPjUd4365TEAOiA0qDOUaxLGfVxqRjD8LQQWAq2Y/F\n2bIfrcgGAP+iGAWzpOKKodgMkHu2CkM1whSDXVd353YdZM7Ek8ObC5vp1uundv3p\nOL59KzQVIiQgt8OV8c8P\n=Yn9i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T15:51:39Z"}},"c