,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jannisrfst","id":101525736,"login":"Jannisrfst","node_id":"U_kgDOBg0o6A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dxfrontier/kyverno-dashboard/commits/48ff329573a7200c81346017cb405361645ef637/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T12:50:22Z","email":"101525736+Jannisrfst@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jannisrfst"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T12:50:22Z","email":"101525736+Jannisrfst@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jannisrfst"},"message":"Initial release: standalone Kyverno policy dashboard\n\nTwo-container architecture (Go backend + React SPA) providing read-only\nvisibility into Kyverno policies and PolicyReports on any Kubernetes cluster.\n\nBackend:\n- Go 1.23 with dynamic informers for kyverno.io/v1, policies.kyverno.io/v1alpha1,\n  and wgpolicyk8s.io/v1alpha2 resources\n- REST API: GET /api/policies, /api/policies/:name, /api/reports\n- In-memory cache with 5-minute resync, partial sync tolerance\n- Distroless container image, non-root, read-only root filesystem\n\nFrontend:\n- React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 6 + Tailwind CSS v4\n- Policy table with severity badges, pass/fail counters, chain grouping\n- Interactive dependency graph (React Flow + dagre) supporting both\n  classic Kyverno v1 and CEL-based policy formats\n- YAML inspector drawer with copy-to-clipboard\n- Violation drill-down per policy\n- Dark mode with system preference detection\n\nDeploy:\n- Kustomize manifests for kyverno-dashboard namespace\n- Read-only ClusterRole (get/list/watch only)\n- Security-hardened pods (readOnlyRootFilesystem, non-root, distroless)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f32e2d84f57a56a20a18fb73049431df1924f4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dxfrontier/kyverno-dashboard/git/trees/7f32e2d84f57a56a20a18fb73049431df1924f4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dxfrontier/kyverno-dashboard/git/commits/48ff329573a7200c81346017cb405361645ef637","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101525736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jannisrfst","id":101525736,"login":"Jannisrfst","node_id":"U_kgDOBg0o6A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jannisrfst","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dxfrontier/kyverno-dashboard/commit/48ff329573a7200c81346017cb405361645ef637","node_id":"C_kwDORjSgbdoAKDQ4ZmYzMjk1NzNhNzIwMGM4MTM0NjAxN2NiN