/api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/9cd5319d2587ce69eff97776ef895dff98dbb5e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T05:55:20Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T05:55:20Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"message":"Add updater, tray, global shortcuts, settings\n\nIntroduce auto-update support, system tray, and robust global shortcut handling; refactor settings/storage and enhance local model metadata.\n\nKey changes:\n- Add Tauri updater plugin support (package.json, src-tauri/Cargo.toml, tauri.conf.json) and updater UI/service components.\n- Add system tray with show/quit handling (src-tauri/src/tray.rs) and register updater/tray during app setup (src-tauri/src/lib.rs).\n- Implement global shortcut plugin initialization and registration command (src-tauri/src/shortcuts.rs) and wire update_global_shortcuts into invoke handler.\n- Refactor frontend settings to use a centralized settings store, migrate shortcut UI to new bindings API, and surface errors via a new error store (various Svelte components and settings files).\n- Enhance local model handling: store HuggingFace pipeline_tag and tags, fetch model metadata when downloading to detect capabilities, minor cleanup/formatting in llama model code.\n- Improve platform GPU variant logic to hide AMD HIP when NVIDIA is present, add build/profile tweaks for release/dev in Cargo.toml.\n- Expand Tauri capabilities/permissions for clipboard, fs, stronghold, global-shortcut and updater usage.\n- Misc: update .gitignore, eslint config to include .svelte.ts, small UI/accessibility tweaks (titlebar, screenshot overlay), and add UpdateNotification component.","tree":{"sha":"dc668bed461f0a9373c877bde4bc1bf26a5f4e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/trees/dc668bed461f0a9373c877bde4bc1bf26a5f4e1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/commits/9cd5319d2587ce69eff97776ef895dff98dbb5e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56925882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io/aioverlay/commit/9cd5319d2587ce69eff97776ef895dff98dbb5e1","node_id":"C_kwDORjZWFNoAKDljZDUzMTlkMjU4N2NlNjllZmY5Nzc3NmVmODk1ZGZmOThkYmI1ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io/aioverlay/commit/85935b0c74e3d69f8943c8584a73cb33dbb0c995","sha":"85935b0c74e3d69f8943c8584a73cb33dbb0c995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/85935b0c74e3d69f8943c8584a73cb33dbb0c995"}],"sha":"9cd5319d2587ce69eff97776ef895dff98dbb5e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/9cd5319d2587ce69eff97776ef895dff98dbb5e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56925882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/85935b0c74e3d69f8943c8584a73cb33dbb0c995/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T00:53:16Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T00:53:16Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"message":"Add Rust AI proxy, SSE streaming & encryption\n\nIntroduce a Rust-side AI HTTP proxy and unify streaming + on-disk encryption. Adds src-tauri/ai_proxy.rs to securely store provider API keys in-memory, manage active stream aborts, and perform HTTP SSE streaming from the Rust process (so keys never touch the webview). Registers new Tauri commands and manages state in lib.rs; enables tokio time feature and tightens CSP to remove direct provider connect URLs.\n\nRefactors JS/TS AI providers to use a new generic streamSSE helper and provider-specific SSE line parsers (sseParser.ts), and implements a rustProxy client (rustProxy.ts) to start/cancel streams via the Rust proxy. Removes duplicated streaming logic from provider implementations and drops API key fields from AIRequestConfig.\n\nAdds AES-256-GCM chat file encryption (chatEncryption.ts) and updates chatHistory.ts to read/write encrypted files with automatic plaintext->encrypted migration and an ephemeral conversation helper. UI tweaks: ephemeral indicator in ChatArea, batching/pending indicator in ChatInput, new DownloadProgressBar component and download progress utilities used by model downloader and local setup. Also adds small styling and UX fixes across components.","tree":{"sha":"17fcd25091cab19feab5aa5ce4d2c1d6e02a9593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/trees/17fcd25091cab19feab5aa5ce4d2c1d6e02a9593"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/commits/85935b0c74e3d69f8943c8584a73cb33dbb0c995","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56925882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/o