6:27Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"message":"Add checksum verification and UI improvements\n\nVerify downloaded llama-server assets with SHA-256: fetch SHA256SUMS, compute file hash, and error out on mismatch (best-effort, logs warning when checksum missing). Refactor archive extraction helpers and small Rust formatting cleanups. Introduce UI components and features: AttachmentPreview, ChatStatusBar, ServerControls, SettingsSection, and attachment support in ChatInput (inline screenshot markdown). Add quick prompts in ChatArea and searchable ConversationList with empty/match states. Reorganize Settings into collapsible sections, show global shortcut registration status, add model downloader/verifying state text, and wire web-search toggle + model capability flags (supportsWebSearch) into provider implementations (Anthropic/Gemini) so tooling is enabled when requested. Misc: various icon swaps and minor UI/UX tweaks across components.","tree":{"sha":"54353b7800215f6eca60a8fda84878e48a6a2f74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/trees/54353b7800215f6eca60a8fda84878e48a6a2f74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/commits/37bb6834b895b2c0cd0f7b0d902a2ca93eeb3d1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56925882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"htt