6-03-10T19:00:55Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T19:00:55Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"message":"Add confirm dialogs, click-through and shortcuts\n\nIntroduce a reusable ConfirmDialog component and wire it into ConversationList, ModelDownloader and LocalModelSetup to require confirmation for destructive actions. Enhance UI/UX: ChatArea shows shortcut hints, an ''incomplete'' marker for partial messages, and a dismissable error banner; ChatInput accepts a prefillText prop and auto-applies captured text; page-level state binds prefillText and uses captureText to prefill instead of auto-sending. Persist and expose window pin/click-through controls in Titlebar (with auto-pin when enabling click-through). Also improve conversation title generation by stripping markdown images and defaulting to ''Screenshot Analysis'' for empty text, and update README shortcut and click-through wording. These changes improve safety (confirmations), discoverability (shortcuts), and user control over captured content and window behavior.","tree":{"sha":"4924754b0d583ba6f584629099f30771982043df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/trees/4924754b0d583ba6f584629099f30771982043df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/commits/9b388e6f0f9f43a9dd2d797d2c5f3ad4d8b0f1bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56925882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io/aioverlay/commit/9b388e6f0f9f43a9dd2d797d2c5f3ad4d8b0f1bb","node_id":"C_kwDORjZWFNoAKDliMzg4ZTZmMGY5ZjQzYTlkZDJkNzk3ZDJjNWYzYWQ0ZDhiMGYxYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io/aioverlay/commit/91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf","sha":"91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf"}],"sha":"9b388e6f0f9f43a9dd2d797d2c5f3ad4d8b0f1bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/9b388e6f0f9f43a9dd2d797d2c5f3ad4d8b0f1bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56925882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T18:52:38Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T18:52:38Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"message":"Refactor markdown, SSE parsing, time & UI utils\n\nMajor refactor and improvements across renderer, AI providers, and UI utilities:\n\n- Security: tighten tauri CSP to restrict sources and allow API/localhost connections.\n- Time utils: add formatRelativeTime / formatRelativeTimeShort and replace inline time formatters in ChatArea and ConversationList.\n- SSE & errors: add shared sseParser (parseOpenAISSEChunk, sanitizeApiError) and wire it into OpenAI, local, Gemini and Anthropic providers to unify stream parsing and produce sanitized, user-friendly API error messages.\n- Markdown rendering: remove module-level pending state, introduce per-render pendingBlocks via RenderResult; configure marked once and pass scoped pending blocks into applyHighlighting; update Markdown component to consume RenderResult. This avoids cross-render races and scopes async highlighting.\n- Screenshot overlay: cache HTMLImageElement to avoid repeated image loads and simplify redraw/crop logic for better performance.\n- Settings & shortcuts: add API key removal when empty, track previous shortcut keys to avoid unnecessary re-registration, remove the Web Search toggle from shortcuts UI and related bindings.\n- Local manager: validate stored port (NaN/range) when reading from localStorage.\n- Chat store/types: validate active provider from storage, mark streamed partial assistant messages as incomplete, clean up unused imports/exports.\n- Routes & static: adjust imports (move some functions to chatHistory), delete unused static SVG assets, and minor CSS whitespace cleanup.\n\nThese changes improve safety, performance, and correctness of streaming, markdown highlighting, and global shortcut handling.","tree":{"sha":"4f279f57b8deb050d2aabdc888bdcbfac667d32f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/trees/4f279f57b8deb050d2aabdc888bdcbfac667d32f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/commits/91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56925882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io/aioverlay/commit/91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf","node_id":"C_kwDORjZWFNoAKDkxZTFkMDAzZTJkYWJiNjRmNDk1ZDQzMDY3MGQ3YzBiMWFlZGFiYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io/aioverlay/commit/0a32cb4b5fd39318f9594c62733e92a2b8bb2923","sha":"0a32cb4b5fd39318f9594c62733e92a2b8bb2923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/0a32cb4b5fd39318f9594c62733e92a2b8bb2923"}],"sha":"91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/91e1d003e2dabb64f495d430670d7c0b1aedabbf"},{"author":{"avatar_ur