ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/b4066d157f71d7fbe51215e2507e94849c1bb497/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T16:59:33Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T16:59:33Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"message":"Add global shortcut manager and settings UI\n\nIntroduce a global shortcut management system and UI pieces.\n\n- Add src/lib/services/shortcuts/shortcutManager.ts: manages registering/unregistering Tauri global shortcuts, reads bindings from localStorage, exposes registerShortcuts(), onShortcutAction(), and cleanupShortcuts(). Handles copy (clipboard) and screenshot actions and focuses the overlay window when triggered.\n- Add ShortcutRecorder, SystemPrompt, and ToggleSwitch components under src/lib/components/settings/ to provide shortcut recording, persistent system prompt textarea, and a reusable toggle UI.\n- Update Settings.svelte to bind and persist systemPrompt, include SystemPrompt component, and re-register global shortcuts after saving settings.\n- Update src/routes/+page.svelte to register shortcuts on mount, wire onShortcutAction to handle captureText/captureScreen, and cleanup shortcuts on teardown. (Note: screen capture flow is left as TODO.)\n\nThese changes persist shortcut bindings and system prompt in localStorage and integrate global shortcut handling into the app lifecycle.","tree":{"sha":"f523bb22e37a611a33e2f6c31e7c9a112cf4730a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/trees/f523bb22e37a611a33e2f6c31e7c9a112cf4730a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/