}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/crony-io","id":56925882,"login":"crony-io","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTI1ODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crony-io","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/commits/f6edf3ee6d1c5970fe37bd24865742cb3edf118b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T16:58:33Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T16:58:33Z","email":"rafael@crony.io","name":"Rafael Andrews"},"message":"Refactor UI styles, markdown renderer & settings\n\nApply formatting and refactors across the app: normalize CSS values/quotes and tidy Svelte markup/props for readability; compact JSON arrays in Tauri capability file. Overhaul markdown rendering: move to a renderer module using marked + Shiki, sanitize output with DOMPurify, add async syntax highlighting, add code-block wrappers with copy buttons and handlers. Update Markdown component to use the new renderer and apply highlighting. Improve settings UI by introducing ShortcutRecorder/ToggleSwitch usage, type active provider, and simplify bindings for ApiKeysList and GlobalShortcuts. Misc: small code-style cleanups in AI provider modules, chatHistory/storage/write calls formatting, chatStore minor refactor, and Vite/Svelte config quoting/formatting adjustments.","tree":{"sha":"5a8a0b211e80d7f21f750874de83a21c154a95b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crony-io/aioverlay/git/trees/5a8a0b211e80d7f21f750874de83a21c154a95b1"},"url":"http