 the default for chat, classroom, modals, and AI surfaces.\n\nCode:\n- New ChapterDetailView with hero, 4 stat cards, animated mastery ring,\n  next-up Resume card, lesson rows with mini-charts and red doodled stars\n- CourseView routes between detail and list based on activeChapter\n- ChapterCard re-skinned to white-card-on-cream; AnimatePresence inline\n  expansion removed (detail view replaces it)\n- New CSS variable namespace --p-* under .theme-paper scope\n- Caveat + Inter added to Google Fonts link\n\nDocs (per CLAUDE.md doc practice):\n- PROJECT_HISTORY: April 2026 v7 entry — design exploration narrative\n- TECH_MEMORY: theme scoping decision, F design tokens, expansion-removal\n  rationale, quiz-scores schema gap noted\n- CHANGELOG: April 28 v7 entry with bullets and impact lines\n- DEFENSE_BRIEF: 3 new Q&A entries (warm theme scope, expansion drop,\n  handwriting font use)\n\nDesign exploration artifacts saved at:\n~/.gstack/projects/RajaMDM-braindrop/designs/course-chapter-20260428/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf3732834141291b47503b0b5fc0c64007acffa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/cf3732834141291b47503b0b5fc0c64007acffa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/1c71ebba8bd0ec4cc103df3ac14e317aa2d32d8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/o