64ebde35c233d758d44cbb26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:29:11Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:29:11Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: QuizCard and FlashcardDeck now accept the actual data shapes from parser\n\nROOT CAUSE FOUND: Claude returns perfect <quiz-data> JSON, but:\n1. Parser normalizes to flat array: [{q, options, answer, ...}]\n2. QuizCard expected {questions: [{q, options, correct, ...}]}\n3. FlashcardDeck expected {cards: [{front, back}]}\n\nBoth components returned null (rendered nothing) because data.questions\nand data.cards were undefined.\n\nFixes:\n- QuizCard: accepts both flat array and {questions:[...]} shapes\n- QuizCard: accepts answer/correct/correctAnswer field names\n- FlashcardDeck: accepts both flat array and {cards:[...]} shapes\n- Correct answer highlighting also fixed (was reading q.correct only)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"368915e303dceb6ada6e4c80ad66208b6e7b2801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/368915e303dceb6ada6e4c80ad66208b6e7b2801"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/e5beb870a29f746264ebde35c233d758d44cbb26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://ap