mments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:23:16Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:23:16Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: two-step conversion for Quiz/Flashcard — stops relying on AI format compliance\n\nPrompt engineering failed 3 times. Free models and even Claude don''t\nreliably generate <quiz-data>/<flashcard-data> JSON tags on first try.\n\nNew approach: two-step conversion.\n1. First call: let any AI provider respond naturally (no format pressure)\n2. Check: if response has no structured tags, make a SECOND call to\n   Claude with a tiny focused prompt: \"Convert this into JSON format\"\n   - No KB, no memory, no exam patterns — just the conversion task\n   - Claude excels at this simple formatting task\n3. If conversion succeeds, use the converted response\n4. If it fails, show the original plain text (graceful degradation)\n\nThis is robust because:\n- Step 1 uses any provider (NVIDIA/Gemini/Claude) for content generation\n- Step 2 uses Claude specifically for JSON formatting (its strength)\n- The conversion prompt is tiny (~2KB) so no truncation issues\n- Worst case: student sees plain text instead of broken nothing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"594c77257436c96a0d1d97b06c8f1499c5b356a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/594c77257436c96a0d1d97b06c8f1499c5b356a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/77e0f259dd35b2f54b4275fae485244d11c6a649","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/77e0f259dd35b2f54b4275fae485244d11c6a649","node_id":"C_kwDORjeei9oAKDc3ZTBmMjU5ZGQzNWIyZjU0YjQyNzVmYWU0ODUyNDRkMTFjNmE2NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be","sha":"9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be"}],"sha":"77e0f259dd35b2f54b4275fae485244d11c6a649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/77e0f259dd35b2f54b4275fae485244d11c6a649"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:19:33Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:19:33Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: parser now handles Claude''s JSON format variations\n\nClaude wraps <quiz-data> and <flashcard-data> in markdown code fences\n(```json ... ```) which prevented the parser from finding the tags.\nClaude also uses different field names (correctAnswer vs answer,\nquestion vs q).\n\nFixes:\n1. Strip ```json fences around custom tags before parsing\n2. Normalize quiz fields: correctAnswer→answer, question→q\n3. Handle wrapped formats: {questions:[...]}, {cards:[...]}\n4. Normalize flashcard fields: question→front, answer→back\n5. Graceful fallback for any field naming variation\n\nThis makes the parser resilient to ANY AI provider''s JSON style.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14aff8f7ce25dbf5d07cba0aad70c6cc4af7199c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/14aff8f7ce25dbf5d07cba0aad70c6cc4af7199c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be","node_id":"C_kwDORjeei9oAKDlhYTI3Y2U2NjdjZGIyMTkzY2QxMWJjNzFlMzY3MDNmZjQyMjIxYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/3838234963973d9668961ae0152ad86d3bd1e0db","sha":"3838234963973d9668961ae0152ad86d3bd1e0db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/3838234963973d9668961ae0152ad86d3bd1e0db"}],"sha":"9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/9aa27ce667cdb2193cd11bc71e36703ff42221be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/3838234963973d9668961ae0152ad86d3bd1e0db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:08:36Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:08:36Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: force Claude for Quiz and Flashcard modes — free models can''t do JSON\n\nFree-tier models (NVIDIA Llama, Gemini, Groq) consistently fail to\ngenerate structured <quiz-data> and <flashcard-data> JSON blocks.\nThey return plain text encouragement instead of actual quiz questions.\n\nFix: Quiz and Flashcard modes now force Claude as the primary provider.\nClaude reliably follows structured output instructions and generates\nvalid JSON every time.\n\n- tryOrder for quiz/flashcard: Claude first, then fallback to others\n- Claude rate limiting skipped for quiz/flashcard modes (they need it)\n- All other modes still use free providers first (NVIDIA > Groq > Gemini)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8682611e915888d5f984e46132b79af996e4f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/b8682611e915888d5f984e46132b79af996e4f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/3838234963973d9668961ae0152ad86d3bd1e0db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"l