MDM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/f3431dc4a95d0e7d162ec3f5d229520109818076/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:07:10Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:07:10Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: inject quiz/flashcard format into user message (not just system prompt)\n\nGemini ignores system_instruction for structured JSON output. The AI\nkept generating plain text descriptions instead of <quiz-data> and\n<flashcard-data> JSON blocks.\n\nFix: for quiz and flashcard modes, append the format requirement\ndirectly to the user message so every AI provider (including Gemini)\nsees it in the conversation context, not just in system instructions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9de563434c717d4c3c1f7e05fcc1989429df9d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/9de563434c717d4c3c1f7e05fcc1989429df9d16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/f3431dc4a95d0e7d162ec3f5d229520109818076","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url"