itter":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:01:51Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: Quiz and Flashcard modes now generate structured JSON reliably\n\nRoot cause: AI was outputting plain text descriptions instead of\n<quiz-data> and <flashcard-data> JSON tags because:\n1. Mode-specific instructions were AFTER the base prompt + KB + memory\n2. System prompt truncation (20K limit) cut off the mode instructions\n3. AI never saw the structured output format requirement\n\nFixes:\n- Quiz/Flashcard mode instructions now placed FIRST in system prompt\n  (before base prompt) so they survive truncation\n- Instructions rewritten with ⚠️ CRITICAL warnings and exact JSON\n  examples the AI must copy\n- Explicit warning: \"If you do NOT output tags, the app WILL BREAK\"\n- Added subject name into quiz/flashcard examples for relevance\n\nAlso confirmed: \"Alishba\" name is NOT hardcoded — it comes from the\nstudent''s actual login name. Working as designed.\n\nHindi MagicBlock blank space: caused by canvas not rendering (known\nissue with AI-generated canvas code). Full-screen popup mitigates this.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b38414705298e16edc96ecbefb731683a1cbc910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/b38414705298e16edc96ecbefb731683a1cbc910"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/cfbc0ff9598e8954dec516191a9bbaac16d76138","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":5439