url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/aa77db0c4d03d96c911c90799d3536a899dec773/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T13:37:26Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T13:37:26Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: AI reliability — timeout, prompt truncation, Groq failure resilience\n\nRoot cause of \"all AI engines busy\" errors:\n1. Groq API key expired (returns \"Forbidden\") — needs manual refresh\n2. System prompts can be 30K+ chars with NCERT RAG content, exceeding\n   free-tier token limits on NVIDIA/Groq/Gemini\n3. No request timeout — hung requests blocked the entire fallback chain\n\nFixes:\n- Added 30-second timeout (AbortController) on all proxy fetch calls\n- System prompt truncated to 20K chars for free-tier providers, 40K for Claude\n- Both callProvider() and callProviderWithSys() get these protections\n- Fallback chain now fails fast on timeout instead of hanging indefinitely\n\nAction needed: refresh Groq API key:\n  npx wrangler secret put GROQ_API_KEY --name braindrop-ai-proxy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84a2395abc78d074cc58c3fa895778e5f1160c68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/84a2395abc78d074cc58c3fa895778e5f1160c68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/aa77db0c4d03d96c911c90799d3536a899dec773","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht