"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/c5b88cc97ea26663fff3d530c4cbfdddf7677c40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T05:56:07Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T05:56:07Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: MagicBlocks now render as React components with full-screen button\n\nRoot cause: MarkdownRenderer extracted quiz and flashcard placeholders\nas React components, but magic blocks were left as raw HTML in\ndangerouslySetInnerHTML — so our MagicBlock component (with full-screen\npopup) was never used. Students saw a tiny inline iframe instead.\n\nFix: MarkdownRenderer now finds magic block placeholders by\ndata-magic-index attribute, extracts them from the HTML string, and\nrenders them as <MagicBlock> React components with:\n- Compact 280px preview in chat\n- \"Open Full Screen\" button\n- Full-viewport modal overlay on click\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a97dd689c1ab0dacfb28268a4c66e473a8a3a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/4a97dd689c1ab0dacfb28268a4c66e473a8a3a5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/c5b88cc97ea26663fff3d530c4cbfdddf7677c40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","recei