MDM"},"message":"fix: MagicBlock — provide complete working canvas template in system prompt\n\nRoot cause: AI generated <canvas> without width/height attributes, causing\ninvisible drawings (default 300x150 but code assumed larger dimensions).\n\nFix: replaced vague CSS rules with a COMPLETE working example that the AI\nmust follow exactly. Includes:\n- Canvas with explicit width=\"440\" height=\"260\" attributes\n- Working draw() function with clearRect, grid, and shapes\n- Slider controls wired to redraw\n- Output card with formula/result\n- All CSS classes pre-defined\n- CRITICAL rules: always set canvas dimensions, always call draw()\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1c018d1acab2eba4d8921c5506668a05270506a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/d1c018d1acab2eba4d8921c5506668a05270506a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/ab262d39a14b9dfd8f71057481e7aeac0fa8bf25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raja