or results/steps\n  - .controls and .control-group CSS classes for consistent control layout\n  - Step-by-step calculation display with .step elements\n  - Gradient button (pink-to-purple) with hover/active feedback\n  - Touch-friendly: min 44px targets, wide sliders\n  - Responsive: flex-wrap, max-width, percentage widths\n- Increased iframe default height from 400px to 520px (expanded: 750px)\n- Added subtitle, legend, and control-group patterns to prompt\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b88f3092445ce3cc9e0cd5bdb3be62fce4518e59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/b88f3092445ce3cc9e0cd5bdb3be62fce4518e59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/7651213e28c8eea93898ff7a6cca86b291e6e433","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/7651213e28c8eea93898ff7a6cca86b291e6e433","node_id":"C_kwDORjeei9oAKDc2NTEyMTNlMjhjOGVlYTkzODk4Zm