l={{ opacity: 1 }} across 11 component files.\n\n2. useCourseProgress.getCourseProgress() called loadMemory() which\n   triggers setState, causing infinite re-renders when called during\n   render. Fixed: read from `memory` state directly instead.\n\n3. ChapterCard called loadMemory() during render — same loop.\n   Fixed: read from `memory` state.\n\n4. useMemory useEffect depended on loadMemory callback ref which\n   changed every render. Fixed: depend on [grade, subject] primitives.\n\n5. AppContext value object recreated every render causing all context\n   consumers to re-render. Fixed: wrapped in useMemo.\n\n6. CourseView temporarily disabled in HeroView to break remaining\n   render cascade — TODO: re-enable after full stabilization.\n\nAlso added ErrorBoundary in App.jsx — crashes now show a friendly\nerror screen with \"Reset & Refresh\" button instead of blank page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f45e7d3cd7592bd907378bbd596a2af6751a73eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/f45e7d3cd7592bd907378bbd596a2af6751a73eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/6f1a4411685d480dce3e43ecc6bfa6287a4b9b8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/6f1a4411685d480dce3e43ecc6bfa6287a4b9b8e","node_id":"C_kwDORjeei9oAKDZmMWE0NDExNjg1ZDQ4MGRjZTNlNDNlY2M2YmZhNjI4N2E0YjliOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/efab66f36e52dbf1e2fbdeb2df48b85d9c82471a","sha":"efab66f36e52dbf1e2fbdeb2df48b85d9c82471a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/efab66f36e52dbf1e2fbdeb2df48b85d9c82471a"}],"sha":"6f1a4411685d480dce3e43ecc6bfa6287a4b9b8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/6f1a4411685d480dce3e43ecc6bfa6287a4b9b8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/efab66f36e52dbf1e2fbdeb2df48b85d9c82471a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T05:08:40Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T05:08:40Z","email":"raja.cloudmdm@gmail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"fix: showCertificate naming collision — state vs function conflict\n\nThe AppContext had both a state field ''showCertificate'' (value: null or subject)\nand a dispatcher function ''showCertificate''. When spread into the context value\nobject, the function overwrote the state, causing AppShell to crash on render.\n\nFix: renamed the dispatcher to ''triggerCertificate''. State field stays as\n''showCertificate'' for reading, function is ''triggerCertificate'' for dispatching.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b6d59f0aa11d60a9aa53be2cc07c934808c4f94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/8b6d59f0aa11d60a9aa53be2cc07c934808c4f94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/efab66f36e52dbf1e2fbdeb2df48b85d9c82471a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_vie