: builds TF-IDF index (term frequency * inverse doc frequency)\n- ragSearch(): scores chunks against user query, returns top 5 most relevant\n- System prompt now receives only the most relevant ~2500 chars instead of 45-50K\n- Dramatically reduces token usage while improving answer relevance\n- RAG index auto-builds on PDF load and subject switch\n- UI shows \"RAG Search Active (N chunks)\" when index is ready\n- Falls back to truncated full text if no relevant chunks found\n- Both sysP() and classroomSysP() use RAG-aware knowledge base\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0a1dcc1f624879caa1ad9b856f5c444e4ef23f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/a0a1dcc1f624879caa1ad9b856f5c444e4ef23f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/5ce1b0a68fc5b1fa00745edcf5637746a5b41193","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM/braindrop/commit/5ce1b0a68fc5b1fa