, Science (16), English (10), Social Science (12), Hindi (10)\n- Each chapter has sequential lessons aligned with NCERT textbook structure\n- Linear unlock system: first 2 chapters open, rest unlock as you complete previous\n- Chapter cards show progress bars, lesson counts, lock/unlock status\n- Click chapter to expand lesson list, click lesson to start learning in any mode\n- Lessons auto-complete after AI interaction via _pendingLesson tracking\n- XP rewards: 20 per lesson, 50 per chapter completion, 100 per subject completion\n- Certificate celebration overlay on completing all chapters in a subject\n- Course progress persisted in localStorage per grade/subject memory profile\n- showW() renders course view (chapters) instead of flat topic chips when available\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a1292cd7a2abe6f424085be83d1bb9d783419c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/1a1292cd7a2abe6f424085be83d1bb9d783419c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/6e60c55cb7ac31bdae6d06b43c1b2f505bc81443","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaMDM","id":54392220,"login":"RajaMDM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzkyMjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/starred{/owner}{/repo}",