ail.com","name":"RajaMDM"},"message":"feat: major platform upgrade — Classroom, MagicBlocks, Assessment, Analytics, Security\n\n- Classroom Mode: Multi-agent classroom with AI Teacher (Ms. Sharma) and AI Classmate\n  (Arjun) using separate AI providers for lecture + discussion interactions\n- MagicBlocks: AI-generated interactive HTML simulations rendered as sandboxed iframes,\n  with auto-detect, /sim command, and \"Generate Simulation\" button\n- Assessment System: Structured quiz engine with JSON MCQs and auto-grading, flashcard\n  decks with flip animation and mastery tracking, score history panel (🏆)\n- Analytics Dashboard: Subject progress bars, 28-day activity heatmap, strengths/weak\n  areas, AI usage breakdown (📈)\n- Security: Routed all 6 AI providers through Cloudflare Workers proxy — zero API keys\n  exposed to browser. Added cloudflare-worker-proxy.js with all endpoints.\n- Auth: Removed email prompt gate, opened registration (no whitelist), improved guest\n  login with optional email, synced identity across auth flows\n- Zero-config UX: Removed all API key inputs from Settings. Users just open and learn.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"438108401f3b0e3b0abda7dbd2e09de71010637e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/438108401f3b0e3b0abda7dbd2e09de71010637e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/cd4fabf746244556ec58e5a201b9afab9cd9be94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54392220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RajaM