x to remove the negative lookbehind syntax `(?<!\\*)` which caused a fatal parse-time `SyntaxError` on certain browser V8 execution environments.\r\n- Wrapped the external PDF.js CDN loader in a defensive `try/catch` block to prevent ReferenceErrors from halting execution when strict tracker blockers or Incognito mode block the script.\r\n- Explicitly bound all HTML-invoked functions (e.g., bypassLogin) directly to the `window` object to guarantee global availability regardless of parse context.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuiKSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFawQAJnpoYWDWOrWRLlonPvHfOE4\nRycV2YVYXDsSPfkhNcfqqSd9TM+uP3JVuByrokWZomBfMtpfxH5yoNJ+bVrr8LBS\n/MxHBgls8cK1UMe3RktQRmqetzbgXNducKXdzDsVt+V746rCSKhq6cBNjVnRTkWj\neH5dei4YJQYH+n9wbamQLEfqTgB7X6mCDmevLTc4UhjNhujj1MuCSrqZkacqanYj\naxrFiN0Tnmj8g8usEmSalgJrnnGVytVryvgrVeGVCkE7bVSO4u/qa0WsQrq0zwxW\nO1BBcez3bZZ5ujuiSmQRbpufu833zt4esj+uDVukKhVndYqO4Q3RsJ7tHWwxrF6L\npo/dlUWID9KzzyUfJVQX5f/H4R09xQ1SBPi0p4BHnCKUtO5hUzLCwcAARA13J4yX\nyyVnq3mxbssi2CMwH6S/1aOAh643iFT5qMKYYYPwOtoe46Z/Sl1z15SPkjmnfexK\nm3CfaQZ21LEg//SR8l8z8lXOhGFOgDL5S+/z1mJywLBKxLoCd2ToSyroeWkVlXGE\nuXSjhaVjTrSa4KAQp+rEiBdNjKtNgFniCEmw4P7Xo9z6gjUcw6WN7Ps8xoQjxagr\n+oeOeUuooa7QtK0+usHeSLGXEbahi6ouugCNsZazkUJW48GL9tvg2ydcmF9ffgYg\nfGxNvBsZhh8KXy4JkHpe\n=ztMS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T03:57:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github