hub.com/users/RajaMDM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RajaMDM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/commits/32da461296e2b95dca0cb4b5a9ac3c09ee5f9dcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T18:08:51Z","email":"54392220+RajaMDM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raja Shahnawaz Soni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T18:08:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): route AI requests through secure Cloudflare proxy\n\n- Removed vulnerable client-side API requests to Google AI Studio and Groq.\r\n- Rerouted `fetch` calls for Gemini and Groq to the `braindrop-proxy` Cloudflare Worker to protect API keys from browser-level scraping.\r\n- Hardcoded initial state of `gk` and `qk` variables to ''PROXY'' in the frontend `Z` object. This bypasses the UI''s API key requirement, keeping the engines active for users without exposing credentials.\r\n- Mitigates critical risk of rate-limit exhaustion and unauthorized API usage.","tree":{"sha":"a92d428a49f18cd8b7ade3083a5de0c9eca1a618","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/trees/a92d428a49f18cd8b7ade3083a5de0c9eca1a618"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RajaMDM/braindrop/git/commits/32da461296e2b95dca0cb4b5a9ac3c09ee5f9dcd","verification":{"payload":"tree a92d428a49f18cd8b7ade3083a5de0c9eca1a618\nparent de2da54adb73c5c7b4664fe8e3dd47a03743c9f7\nauthor Raja Shahnawaz Soni <54392220+RajaMDM@users.noreply.github.com> 1773770931 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773770931 +0400\n\nfix(security): route AI requests through secure Cloudflare proxy\n\n- Removed vulnerable client-side API requests to Google AI Studio and Groq.\r\n- Rerouted `fetch` calls for Gemini and Groq to the `braindrop-proxy` Cloudflare Worker to protect API keys from browser-level scraping.\r\n- Hardcoded initial state of `gk` and `qk` variables to ''PROXY'' in the frontend `Z` object. This bypasses the UI''s API key requirement, keeping the engines active for users without exposing credentials.\r\n- Mitigates critical risk of rate-limit exhaustion and unauthorized API usage.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuZizCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmv4QAB/Yn9nqZECehbLGmrXV5zGb\nkuh5AcE1ZBkuwRoKN96kxb1/dgZjch1nCEXX29ghGOQsd/0btywxOLKss1RV2WAr\neNEb+rmeo8R3aQFQ7RFFMDJfgNHU2J+VS9QGLx1cggbc+BBGYONxnNbAm520etxJ\nfw7rf1GK1kqC8aFkmgTa3U1f2GO6W+J3UZM5/SUPedmMKHT932TwGj4XFPiX2get\nJyLrNAQ62fpriFVXli5tdKzrA34MbMTG1S1Dfon4Sa2tq5boBquaLrE9sNHszHD/\nGacENJUm8MaxlYRc+deuloQjfEyelgXgfxhyeAP/Z/ecd93LajD6VtSh6MOdhFy4\nvw74jvO5NArUHej+LhnRw5ItgYsDZGMdaGtUg+AVNvJRCj4Q7kqFjD7EXrcyXLsh\n8vdDVvnANmOrXZYO+y7UaoBTgq0l4JV5PhgOEeoBL07wJLy+oU8ohJISyq7h2nB/\nQ4u/ecu/RQqrGvK9MD+YH3Vxc/GxGG8oavz9mvyAMBcJA1b9HxA8Ktgl1mQTsuuR\neeqFQTH7KhHcbsHlD7PI2BF3s5HWGjCP9Zc42qWnQ7HPdxLdv7oOMzRuJptro7DB\nmLYFChIflpb8eR0MvR/rOlWNZHXXmDtSqz0P53QwEYXNQpNZhxYVGuohmzgLdOcz\nr8XrCcFVy1H0XgUgKmfq\n=uaUC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T18:08:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/user