ated requirements to include PyJWT for token management.\n\nfeat: Add authentication to qr-converter-service\n\n- Implemented JWT-based authentication with login endpoint.\n- Added token verification for protected routes.\n- Enhanced conversion repository to store additional data fields.\n- Updated UPN parsing logic to extract more details from payloads.\n\nchore: Create web gateway with rate limiting and CORS support\n\n- Added Dockerfile for web gateway using Krakend.\n- Configured endpoints with rate limiting and CORS settings in krakend.json.\n\nfix: Improve PDF and image conversion handling in qr-converter-service\n\n- Added im\n- Added CircuitBreaker implementation to handle failures when calling the qr-converter-serviceddi- Introduced CORS middleware to allow cross-origin requests.\n- Enhanced mobile UPN request hante- Enhanced mobile UPN request handling with improved error nt- Added new endpoints for circuit breaker status and image screens","tree":{"sha":"d83c6b1604f13e5cdfd3fc7b6b117340e3746f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vukp17/epc-upnqr/git/trees/d83c6b1604f13e5cdfd3fc7b6b117340e3746f8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vukp17/epc-upnqr/git/commits/ea12f8e6f784ee4638d3eba21d2f39e96d2412ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102854990?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vukp17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vukp17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vukp17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vukp17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vukp17","id":102854990,"login":"Vukp17","node_id":"U_kgDOBiFxTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vukp17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vukp17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vukp17/r